OL,3,AGirl, 13, among 33 UK nationals missing
OL,4,Aafter Nepal flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-three people from the UK are
OL,7,Famong hundreds feared missing following
OL,8,Fa deadly flash flood near the
OL,9,FNepal-Tibet border.
OL,11,FFlooding and mud slides hit the Rasuaw
OL,12,Fregion in the morning on Wednesday,
OL,13,Fkilling at least 162 people, police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FNepal's National Disaster Risk
OL,17,FReduction and Management Authority said
OL,18,F826 people are missing, with the number
OL,19,Fof missing tourists said to be more
OL,20,Fthan 529.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
